    <string name="q_title">QUALITY PRESET</string>
    <string name="q_desc">The base preset of the game. The settings below fine-tune single parts of it. Check the label in the bottom left corner of the game to see which preset is active.</string>
    <string name="scale_title">RENDER SCALE</string>
    <string name="scale_desc">Share of the screen resolution the 3D scene is drawn at. 1.0 is sharpest, lower gives more FPS.</string>
    <string name="dist_title">VIEW DISTANCE</string>
    <string name="dist_desc">How far you can see, in percent of the preset. Lower gives more FPS.</string>
    <string name="opt_shadows">Shadows</string>
    <string name="opt_shadows_desc">Real-time shadows. Off gives more FPS.</string>
    <string name="opt_bloom">Bloom</string>
    <string name="opt_bloom_desc">Glow around bright areas. Off gives a cleaner image.</string>
    <string name="aa_title">ANTI-ALIASING</string>
    <string name="aa_desc">Smooths jagged edges. Off is fastest.</string>
    <string name="fx_title">EFFECT QUALITY</string>
    <string name="fx_desc">Quality of particle effects like explosions and smoke.</string>
    <string name="na_title">NOT AVAILABLE</string>
    <string name="na_desc">FOV, grass, sky, textures and stretched resolution are not offered by the game\u2019s config files, so they cannot be changed safely from this app. If the CDRevive developers add such keys to the options.ini, they will show up in the Config tab.</string>
